// REQUIRES: long
// P04.04 (manager decision M3): the checker stays near-linear on the shapes
// that were quadratic or recursed once per link: a chain of package
// variables (and of constants) each initialized from the next one declared
// (declared link by link on stacks of their own, runOnNewStack), rings of
// variables, of constants and of variables and functions (the search for the
// cycle has an explicit stack), a chain that ends in a ring (a walk per link
// would be quadratic), many variables
// depending on many, a switch with N constant cases of two kinds and a
// tagless one (duplicate cases are found by hashing), a struct of N fields
// read and written by name, and keyed literals of it (StructType::ByName).
// N = 10000 and 4N, best of two runs: 4N may take at most 8 times as long.
// This is the first half (the chains and rings of 10000); core-linear-2.long
// has the other shapes and the two long rings, with the same script.
// RUN: %python %S/Inputs/check-units-linear.py --gopp %gopp --gen %S/Inputs/gen-core-stress.py --out %t.d --max-ratio 8 initchain 10000
// RUN: %python %S/Inputs/check-units-linear.py --gopp %gopp --gen %S/Inputs/gen-core-stress.py --out %t.d --max-ratio 8 constchain 10000
// RUN: %python %S/Inputs/check-units-linear.py --gopp %gopp --gen %S/Inputs/gen-core-stress.py --out %t.d --max-ratio 8 cycle 10000
// RUN: %python %S/Inputs/check-units-linear.py --gopp %gopp --gen %S/Inputs/gen-core-stress.py --out %t.d --max-ratio 8 mixcycle 10000
// RUN: %python %S/Inputs/check-units-linear.py --gopp %gopp --gen %S/Inputs/gen-core-stress.py --out %t.d --max-ratio 8 cyctail 10000
